      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 39.12,
        "t": 799.24791953125,
        "r": 172.31999999999996,
        "b": 788.4643393785782
      },
      "content": "Microwave leakage test",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0669",
      "reading_order": 855,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 771.5459195312501,
        "r": 265.743,
        "b": 763.4582344167462
      },
      "content": "Check that the following requirements have been met:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0670",
      "reading_order": 856,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.00000000000003,
        "t": 759.66591953125,
        "r": 163.61100000000002,
        "b": 751.2182344167462
      },
      "content": " The appliance is cool."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0671",
      "reading_order": 857,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.991000000000014,
        "t": 747.66891953125,
        "r": 350.70599999999996,
        "b": 739.2182344167462
      },
      "content": " This test will not operate at a cavity temperature of 70 o C or above."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0672",
      "reading_order": 858,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.01199999999998,
        "t": 722.5829195312501,
        "r": 217.27200000000002,
        "b": 714.4952344167463
      },
      "content": "Follow these instructions when measuring:"
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0138",
      "reading_order": 859,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 364.3959247627679,
        "t": 801.7733886775694,
        "r": 510.6324363675188,
        "b": 714.6113898755578
      },
      "image_path": "figures/figure_0138.png",
      "previous_block_id": "txt_0672",
      "next_block_id": "txt_0673"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0673",
      "reading_order": 860,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.01199999999997,
        "t": 710.9459195312501,
        "r": 560.3700000000001,
        "b": 690.1412344167463
      },
      "content": " Make sure that the survey meter you are using has been calibrated and is suitable for measuring frequencies of 2,450 MHz."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0674",
      "reading_order": 861,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.030000000000086,
        "t": 686.3489195312501,
        "r": 558.8130000000002,
        "b": 665.5442344167463
      },
      "content": " Do not exceed meter full scale deflection. The leakage meter should initially be set to the highest scale, then adjusted down as necessary to ensure that low readings are measured on the most sensitive range."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0675",
      "reading_order": 862,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.04800000000017,
        "t": 661.6349195312501,
        "r": 454.17000000000013,
        "b": 653.1872344167464
      },
      "content": " To prevent false readings, hold the probe on the grip provided and move at 2.5 cm/second."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0676",
      "reading_order": 863,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.03000000000014,
        "t": 649.6379195312502,
        "r": 559.4160000000002,
        "b": 628.8332344167464
      },
      "content": " Always hold the probe at right angles to the oven and point of measurement, ensuring the probe sensor is reading 50 mm from the test area."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0677",
      "reading_order": 864,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.048000000000116,
        "t": 624.9239195312502,
        "r": 251.01300000000015,
        "b": 616.4762344167465
      },
      "content": " The leakage should not exceed 5 mW/cm²."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0678",
      "reading_order": 865,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.0,
        "t": 600.7860195312501,
        "r": 347.0939999999999,
        "b": 592.6983344167462
      },
      "content": "Add 275 ml of cold water into a 600 ml microwave safe container."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0679",
      "reading_order": 866,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.9909999999999,
        "t": 588.7890195312501,
        "r": 375.7589999999998,
        "b": 580.7013344167462
      },
      "content": "Place the 600 ml container in the centre of the cavity and close the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0680",
      "reading_order": 867,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.9819999999998,
        "t": 576.3060195312502,
        "r": 546.1559999999998,
        "b": 556.2213344167463
      },
      "content": "Enter Service Settings / Tests and select 'Microwave leakage' from the appliance tests (microwave power 100% for 30 seconds, convection fan at 10%)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0681",
      "reading_order": 868,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.0,
        "t": 456.78601953125,
        "r": 297.41399999999993,
        "b": 448.6983344167462
      },
      "content": "Set the leakage meter to the appropriate scale/range."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0682",
      "reading_order": 869,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.99099999999996,
        "t": 444.78901953125,
        "r": 540.531,
        "b": 424.4613344167462
      },
      "content": "Move the survey meter probe across all casework joins and vent areas including those marked in yellow, shown opposite."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0683",
      "reading_order": 870,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.0,
        "t": 280.26601953125,
        "r": 531.1619999999999,
        "b": 272.1783344167461
      },
      "content": "When the microwave leakage test stops after 30 seconds, change the water and re-select the test to continue."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0684",
      "reading_order": 871,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.0,
        "t": 255.78601953125008,
        "r": 349.01099999999997,
        "b": 247.6983344167462
      },
      "content": "Select the return arrow on the display to stop the test at any time."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0685",
      "reading_order": 872,
      "section": "Microwave leakage test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.0,
        "t": 231.42601953124995,
        "r": 558.0630000000001,
        "b": 211.0982344167462
      },
      "content": "Readings must be below 5mW/cm², ideally zero as there should be no microwave leakage and corrections should be made if any leakage is detected above 0.5mW/cm 2 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "figure",
      "id": "fig_0139",
